---
import Icon from '../shared/Icon.astro'
---

<section class="mb-14 md:mb-22" aria-labelledby="value-title">
  <div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-2.5">
    <p class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm leading-4 font-semibold tracking-wide whitespace-nowrap text-neutral-400">
      <Icon class="size-4" name="circle-check" />
      Where I add value
    </p>
    <div class="h-px w-full bg-neutral-700"></div>
  </div>

  <h2 id="value-title" class="mb-7 text-2xl leading-tight font-bold text-neutral-50">
    Support across the full product lifecycle.
  </h2>

  <div class="grid gap-4 gap-x-10 md:grid-cols-2">
    <article>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary-400">01</p>
      <h3 class="mt-3 text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-100">Product and workflow discovery</h3>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-neutral-400">
        Clarify the real operational problem, map how people work, and turn stakeholder needs into focused product
        requirements.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary-400">02</p>
      <h3 class="mt-3 text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-100">Fullstack product development</h3>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-neutral-400">
        Build maintainable interfaces, APIs, data models, and administration tools using Angular, NestJS, and
        TypeScript and deploy in a dependable way using Docker and CI/CD
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
